COMM EM RESPONSE SIGN CONVENTION
COMM ----------------------------------------------------------------------
COMM Z-Component response will be positive over a purely conductive        
COMM halfspace.
COMM X-Component is positive in the flight direction
COMM
COMM ----------------------------------------------------------------------
COMM TILT METER SIGN CONVENTION
COMM ----------------------------------------------------------------------
COMM Angle X is positive when the nose of the Tx loop is pitched up.       
COMM Angle Y is positive when the starboard side of the frame is lower     
COMM       than the poert side over level ground.
COMM
